    "items": [
      "Changing a wizard rung `EncThalmor0{2–6}MagicM` 0728AE · 07D960 · 07D966 · 07D96B · 07D972 also needs its boss copy `EncThalmor0{2–6}MagicBossM` 07D987 · 07D988 · 07D989 · 07D98A · 07D98B (levels 14 · 23 · 32 · 40 · 50; on *Thalmor Boss*): each uses its rung as template but not for `Stats`.",
      "The CC Redguard soldiers keep their own level 18 when a rung changes: `ccEDHSSE003_EncThalmor03Melee1HF` uses `EncThalmor03Melee1HM` 07D962 as template without `Stats`, the other two the `EncThalmor00` templates.",
      "The other rows: no other record keeps its own level.",
      "Every other Thalmor record (the female, shield and dual variants, `ValmirBASE`, `TreasCorpseThalmorM`, the `MQ101`, `MQ201`, `MQ202`, `ThalmorEmbassyGuard*`, `DLC2SV02` and CC wrappers, and every `LvlThalmor*` wrapper) carries `Stats` and follows its template or list."
    ]
  },
